    "body": "Thank you for notifying! \r\nThe tutorials are currently in the updating process.\r\nShould be done by the end of the week.\r\n\r\nUntil then: Read out for sampled evaluation can now be specified externally (not tied to the circuit anymore).\r\nIn this example it would be:\r\ntq.simulate(circuit, samples=10, read_out_qubits=[0])\r\n\r\nAs far as I can see it shouldn't affect the rest of the tutorial.",
